目标，然后跳向那个目标。\n\t\t当冰魂进入一个生物体内，那个生物将会被寒霜覆盖，持续 3 回合。\n\t\t- 友方目标：获得 %d%% 寒冷伤害抗性，所造成的所有伤害转化成寒冷伤害，增加寒冷伤害 %d%%。\n\t\t- 敌对目标：降低 %d%% 寒冷伤害抗性，移动速度降低 %d%%。\n\t\t冰魂会优先选择没有被寒霜覆盖的目标。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c1588771f4889c4f12404ffe93ba88f144b4d373d7949af61c605921da5486f9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9b559d7100bb0e12bbce2f140a675589104db8ae00a4f8645ec59f1104a93d9f","logical_entry_identity":"8d5739d3ab9312cf87bbcb8ba5cc9c630428e4b90afd9e0e7884ccb832d2c198","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Deals %d darkness damage and saps the foes energy, reducing all damage dealt by %d%% for %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"造成 %d 暗影伤害，并吸收敌人的能量，使其造成的所有伤害降低 %d%%，持续 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b9909583f54feb2f111b1577f284b3351db54ddcdbdd6f32e5dc909bb6a86127","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9b5a83eb99bee9932a6632b2ee8f19c39a04a34f19cf00f7a0761ceb48be9bb6","logical_entry_identity":"16476d30acab1c9f6e62d94dd32a82d58c0c1405476652185ea05fa21c9c2ab2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Projectile: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"抛射物："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"804d31e247fe6e01f33addc4e09946ad17ff49aac0202468d0091f28f0502cc2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9b5c3130b50257f871e6a5568397ab027506a6d46c35e1dcd53a951979ed081e","logical_entry_identity":"88712d13ca716a1b26e31651f093e13e2d6aea642fffa83ec5abf75e24cc9dcb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Blood spilled on sand, only the strong survive. Prove yourself worthy to enter.","source_tag":"_t","target":"血溅沙场，勇者生存，需证明你有进入的资格。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8a408b0c126be07ba7899f43453a13b430b31f9d46fd0e8ede4ce7eb9a4ee70a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9b65705064fb1fcaf57f57b3639d1779f72a0fe22008c6b4c162e2caec1de6fe","logical_entry_identity":"12de6dda84eedb5321a8de3265c2ae72fd914c569041f55869cb89fb31997c10","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Maligned","source_tag":"_t","target":"-恶意缠身"},{"args_order":null